# admin login 
Post {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login 
Content-Type: application/json


{
    "userId": "super-admin-1975-031" , 
    "password":"12345678"
}


### refresh token 
Post {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json 



### logout 
# also in the front end , must remove the token from the client.
Post {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json


####check-password
Post {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/check-password/22010007
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "password":"12345678"
}

###change-password 
Post {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/change-password/22010007 
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "password":"123456789"
}


### forget-password
Post {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/forget-password
Content-Type: application/json 

{
    "email":"cds.osamamohamed23050@alexu.edu.eg"
}


